<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #1a73e8; color: white; padding: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; }
    .body { padding: 32px 24px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .token-box { background: #f0f4ff; border: 1px solid #d0dfff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-family: monospace; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 20px 0; word-break: break-all; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">Selamat Datang di Mahkota Drive</div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Halo,</p>
      <p>Akun Anda telah berhasil didaftarkan di sistem Mahkota Drive.</p>
      <p>Silakan klik tombol di bawah ini untuk membuat password akun Anda:</p>
      <div style="text-align:center; margin:24px 0;">
        <a href="{{setPasswordLink}}" style="display:inline-block; background:#1a73e8; color:#ffffff; padding:12px 28px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;">
          Buat Password
        </a>
      </div>
      <p>Link ini berlaku selama <strong>15 menit</strong>.</p>
      <p style="font-size:12px; color:#666;">Atau copy link berikut:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{setPasswordLink}}</span></p>
      <p style="margin-top:20px;">Jika Anda merasa tidak mendaftar, abaikan email ini.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">&copy; {{year}} Mahkota Drive. All rights reserved.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
